Package: darts
Title: Statistical Tools to Analyze Your Darts Game
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ryan", "Tibshirani", , "ryantibs@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Are you aiming at the right spot in darts? Maybe not! This
    package estimates the accuracy of your throws from the scores of darts
    aimed at the center of the board, using EM algorithms under a Gaussian
    model, and then computes a personalized heatmap of expected scores to
    find your optimal aiming location. Based on Tibshirani, Price, and
    Taylor (2011) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-985X.2010.00651.x>.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/ryantibs/darts
BugReports: https://github.com/ryantibs/darts/issues
